{id:"ready-meaning",source:"BRIEF.md:9: 'Ready must visibly use a check mark with asymmetrical arms to convey successful completion.' src/queue.ts:3 ok:succeeded; src/queue-view.ts:3,6 idle Start, succeeded Ready.",delta:"Literal required check and asymmetry retained, with qualitative success outcome. No arm ratio, stroke width, backing-shape or highlight restriction.",alternative_disposition:"A thin asymmetrical check, a check with different arm ratios, or a check on a transparent-background decorative shape may pass if it communicates completion. A symmetric check is excluded by the owner, not a specialist invention.",finding:"consistent"},
{id:"readability-1x-3x",source:"BRIEF.md:3: 'readable silhouettes'; 'Inspect at 1x and 3x nearest display scale on the actual dark panel'. src/queue-view.ts:9 background:'#172336', scale:3, filter:'nearest'.",delta:"Uses actual display conditions and asks essential detail to remain readable, without pixel geometry thresholds.",alternative_disposition:"Different readable silhouettes remain allowed. No unsupported quantitative proxy.",finding:"consistent"},
{id:"cool-blue-accent",source:"BRIEF.md:3: 'the existing UI’s cool blue accent; a fixed palette is not required' (apostrophe normalized); assets/start.svg:1 fill='#70b9ed'.",delta:"Dominant cool-blue visual relationship is the interpretation of using existing accent. No exact hex or color-count rule; Start is a color cue, not approved pixel-art style.",alternative_disposition:"Other cool blues and multiple tones remain admissible. A mostly unrelated-colored icon with a token blue pixel may fail this reasonable interpretation.",finding:"consistent"},
